1
00:00:00,049 --> 00:00:02,295
Charles Darwin hampir kalah...

2
00:00:02,295 --> 00:00:04,758
gara-gara sepucuk surat dari Ternate!

3
00:00:04,758 --> 00:00:05,509
Wallace,

4
00:00:05,509 --> 00:00:06,805
penemu Garis Wallace,

5
00:00:06,805 --> 00:00:09,357
menulisnya saat baru sembuh dari demam.

6
00:00:09,357 --> 00:00:13,709
Isinya nyaris sama dengan ide
yang Darwin simpan 20 tahun!

7
00:00:13,709 --> 00:00:16,459
Keduanya lalu dibacakan
bersama di London...

8
00:00:16,459 --> 00:00:17,685
tanpa penulisnya.

9
00:00:17,685 --> 00:00:20,158
Darwin sedang memakamkan bayinya,

10
00:00:20,158 --> 00:00:21,800
Wallace masih di Papua.

11
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,472
Dan surat aslinya...

12
00:00:23,472 --> 00:00:25,539
sampai sekarang tak pernah ditemukan.

13
00:00:25,539 --> 00:00:26,360
Menurutmu,

14
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:28,417
adil nggak dunia cuma ingat Darwin?

15
00:00:28,417 --> 00:00:29,986
Tulis di komentar!
